CM_ BO_ 840 "Observed OBD 6/14 HS1. CAN ID 0x348; ID_DLC_match. PSA-RE name: ENGINE_ECU_STATUS_HEV. Engine ECU status, transmitted in every configuration: traction/motion control acquisition, OBD contact state, engine running state, warm-up cycle completion, refrigerant pressure and MIL lamp request. Source: https://github.com/prototux/PSA-RE/blob/67f7581e7622410efdbb29c7eda3b86982b9b450/buses/AEE2010.full/HS.HS1/348.yml. Database sender alternatives: CMM,E_VCU. ECU labels are database claims; forwarding/physical transmitter not independently identified. All fitting source fields retained, including default/unavailable-only candidates. See audit/source JSON for exclusions and unresolved alternatives.";
